---
import BlogLayout from '../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro';
---

<BlogLayout title="About Me" description="Learn more about the author of this blog">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6">About Me</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg mb-6">
        Welcome to my personal blog, a space where I share my thoughts, ideas, and explorations.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mt-8 mb-4">My Journey</h2>
      <p>
        This blog is a collection of my personal reflections and insights. I created it as a way to document my journey and share what I learn along the way.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mt-8 mb-4">What I Write About</h2>
      <p>
        My posts cover a variety of topics that interest me, from technology and innovation to personal development and creativity. I believe in sharing knowledge and experiences that might be valuable to others.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mt-8 mb-4">Connect With Me</h2>
      <p>
        I'm always open to conversations and connections. Feel free to reach out if you have questions, feedback, or just want to chat about the topics I cover.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
        <p class="text-gray-500 italic">
          "The more that you read, the more things you will know. The more that you learn, the more places you'll go." — Dr. Seuss
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>
